===Etymology===
From French ''crème de la crème'', the "top of the top" or "best of the best".

===Noun===
'''[[crème]] [[de]] [[la]] [[crème]]'''

# {{idiom}} Best of the best; something that's [[superlative]]. The [[very]] [[best]].
#: ''To be an astronaut you must be the '''crème de la crème'''.''

